---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { href } from '../lib/url.js';
import site from '../site.config.ts';
---
<Page title="About" description={`About the ${site.name}, a free sourdough starter feeding calculator.`}>
  <p>{site.name} is a free sourdough starter feeding calculator. You choose a feeding ratio and an amount. It gives you the grams of starter, flour and water to use, and a rough time for the starter to peak.</p>
  <h2>What it does</h2>
  <p>Feeding a starter means doing the same small sum each time. The tool does it for any ratio, hydration and flour mix.</p>
  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <p>The calculator runs in your browser. We do not ask you to create an account. Your last settings stay on your own device so they are ready next time.</p>
  <p>The peak time is a rough guide. It uses the feeding ratio and your kitchen temperature. Real starters differ, so watch your jar.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions or ideas? Write to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or visit the <a href={href('contact/')}>Contact page</a>.</p>
</Page>
